    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present number 40 Dakota Court, a stunning first floor apartment with a southerly aspect overlooking a quiet courtyard. \n\nPresented in excellent condition this spacious and bright 2 bed 2 bath apartment is bright and well -proportioned throughout.\n\nThere is excellent storage throughout with ample built-in wardrobe space in addition to a storage room and a hot-press with in-built storage. \n\nThis property has one designated underground parking space along with secure underground bicycle parking.\n\nThe accommodation includes: entrance hallway with access to storeroom and hotpress, spacious living/dining area and separate kitchen, 2 large double bedrooms one of which has an en-suite bathroom, and a second bathroom. This property is sure to appeal to both owner occupiers and investors looking to acquire an apartment in a much sought after and private development, early viewing is highly recommended.\n\nThe location is all that one could wish for, a short stroll will bring you to the city centre, National Botanic Gardens and all the amenities that Phibsboro village has to offer are nearby. The area is also well serviced by excellent public transport links, including the Luas and Q.B.C.\n\n\nService charge 2680 Dakota management company per year.\n\nViewing by appointment with DNG estate agents in Phibsboro 01 8300989\n\nLocal DNG agents: Brian McGee, Vincent Mullen,Isobel O`Neill, Michelle Keeley & Ciaran Jones ,Isabel O`Neill and Leah Barry MIPAV."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.7m x 1.97m\nEntrance hall is spacious and bright with laminate floor. There is access to a hotpress with shelving for storage.\n\nBathroom - 2.4m x 1.94mn\nBathroom tiled floor to ceiling with shower, W/C and W.H.B and shower.\n\nHotpress - 0.79m x 0.79\nHotpress with shelving for storage.There is wooden flooring.\n\nBedroom 1 - \nDouble bedroom with en-suite .This bedroom is located at the back of the property. There is wooden flooring and built-in wardrobes.\n\nEn-suite - 1.7m x 1.63m\nEn-suite is tiled floor to ceiling with W/C, W.H.B and bath.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nBedroom 2 located at the back of the property.There is wooden flooring and built-in storage.\n\nKitchen - \nKitchen with tiled floor.There ae floor and wall presses.\n\nLiving/dining area - \nLiving/dining area with good light facing onto courtyard.There are floor to ceiling windows for good light.\n\nOutside - \nThere is access to a common area courtyard.There is a secure under ground car park.\n\n"
      },
